      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MYLES KEEPING (1) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 17.65. Yet to miss the placings in six runs from this box, including three wins. Hard to go past. MY MATE ROBBIE (6) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this track and trip which boasts two wins and two placings. Below best last time at this track (23.48) in a Grade 5, finishing a 7 length fifth. Can hit the frame with the right run. KAZAKHSTAN (2) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (17.89) at this track. Returns to favourable track. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. FERNANDO LEE (8) will need to run right up to last start to feature again.",
